{"synopsis":"Joy dan Max adalah rekan kerja pada suatu perusahaan Start-Up.\n\nJoy memiliki kepribadian yang atraktif, senang bersosialisasi dan hebat dalam pekerjaannya, sedangkan Max hampir tidak terlihat, memiliki kecemasan sosial, dan sangat terbiasa melakukan hal sendirian.\n\nTerlepas dari perbedaan mereka, mereka berakhir dalam satu tim yang sama, dan duduk bersebelahan.\n\nTapi pada hari pertama mereka sebagai rekan tim, Max secara tidak sengaja melihat sesuatu pada layar monitor milik Joy yang tidak seharusnya diperlihatkan kepada orang lain!\n\nMulai dari momen itu, Kehidupan kerja Max yang tenang mulai berubah menjadi lebih kacau...","alternative_title":"이직로그","author":"Woo Simok","artist":"Lee Haan","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"af28baf0-d282-4c8c-b087-63b5fef78f7d","number":"54","chapter":"54","title":"Chapter 54","date":"2026-03-18","released":"2026-03-18","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"4c2eefe7-b3c3-4577-b730-cc2a6db47bc3","number":"53","chapter":"53","title":"Chapter 53","date":"2026-03-08","released":"2026-03-08","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"a72bf418-e91d-44d5-bc2f-513390c3135e","number":"52","chapter":"52","title":"Chapter 52","date":"2026-03-02","released":"2026-03-02","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"aa61001e-23c7-4438-995b-67fe1fa8610c","number":"51","chapter":"51","title":"Chapter 51","date":"2026-02-23","released":"2026-02-23","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"36bfc33b-23fd-430c-9e32-d1bdda8de23c","number":"50","chapter":"50","title":"Chapter 50","date":"2026-02-15","released":"2026-02-15","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"b6a422e6-a18f-4bd3-b530-db89b901870b","number":"49","chapter":"49","title":"Chapter 49","date":"2026-02-10","released":"2026-02-10","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"64b1dfcb-50f2-4fc9-9d24-e0ae9668282d","number":"48","chapter":"48","title":"Chapter 48","date":"2026-02-03","released":"2026-02-03","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"559e0226-b585-4e95-b0e3-69b8f1ec3c7e","number":"47","chapter":"47","title":"Chapter 47","date":"2026-01-20","released":"2026-01-20",